hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"662","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Khachchar darindon mein se hai.'"
"663","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo jangal mein rahe woh sakht mizaj ho jata hai. Jo shikar ke peeche pade woh ghafil ho jata hai. Jo badshahon ke darwazon par aata jata rahe woh fitnon mein pad jata hai. Aur aadmi badshah se jitna qareeb hota hai, Allah se utna door ho jata hai.'"
"664","[AI-translation] Ya'la bin Ubaid se isi sanad se riwayat hai; is mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo badshahon ke darwazon par aane jane ko aadat bana le.'"
